    "text": "westportjournal.com\nwebsite\nWestport\nWoman charged with stealing clothes from Mitchell’s\nBy Rozanne Gates,\n9 hours agoWESTPORT–A 25-year-old Old Greenwich, Connecticut woman has been arrested and charged with stealing thousands of dollars’ worth of clothes from Mitchell’s Department Store, 670 Post Road East. Westport police said surveillance footage also appeared to show the woman, Rachel Lewis, switching price tags on stolen merchandise and conducting fraudulent returns.\n1",
